WEBVTT

00:11.010 --> 00:13.340
<b>You've been out playing too much</b>

00:13.480 --> 00:16.280
<b>since your father's been away.</b>

00:16.410 --> 00:18.180
<b>Mother...</b>

00:18.310 --> 00:19.680
<b>Don't put me on the spot.</b>

00:20.020 --> 00:23.350
<b>I was headed for practice with Yataro
at Ichigaya.</b>

00:23.490 --> 00:26.520
<b>Practice without taking your sword?</b>

00:27.490 --> 00:28.520
<b>No!</b>

00:30.230 --> 00:33.530
<b>I have it set up right there.</b>

00:34.460 --> 00:38.300
<b>-Ojun, be a good girl with your mother.
-Ouch!</b>

00:39.200 --> 00:42.140
<b>Hey, that hurts! I surrender!</b>

00:42.270 --> 00:44.440
<b>All right! I'll bring back</b>

00:44.570 --> 00:45.780
<b>candy from Kiriya for you.</b>

00:46.110 --> 00:47.340
<b>Candy?</b>

00:49.380 --> 00:50.610
<b>Mother,</b>

00:50.750 --> 00:52.520
<b>I'll be back soon.</b>

00:54.350 --> 00:56.350
<b>Why don't we play with beanbags?</b>

00:56.490 --> 00:57.520
<b>Yes!</b>

00:59.160 --> 01:00.790
<b>Excuse me...</b>

01:01.120 --> 01:03.290
<b>Pardon me.</b>

01:03.430 --> 01:04.530
<b>What is it?</b>

01:04.660 --> 01:07.530
<b>I was sent by a customer.</b>

01:09.230 --> 01:10.770
<b>For the lady?</b>

01:11.100 --> 01:12.840
<b>Who was this customer?</b>

01:13.170 --> 01:15.440
<b>He seemed like a ronin to me.</b>

01:16.110 --> 01:19.140
<b>He said he didn't need a response.</b>

01:21.640 --> 01:23.080
<b>My lady.</b>

01:23.210 --> 01:24.650
<b>You received a letter.</b>

01:25.210 --> 01:27.220
<b>Thank you.</b>

01:39.090 --> 01:41.300
<b>Tomorrow at four o'clock,</b>

01:41.430 --> 01:42.500
<b>I'll be waiting for you</b>

01:42.630 --> 01:44.270
<b>at tea shop Yoshinoya</b>

01:44.400 --> 01:46.370
<b>in front of the Gokokuji gates.</b>

01:47.300 --> 01:49.510
<b>If you will not come to me,</b>

01:49.640 --> 01:53.310
<b>please know that I will come to you.</b>

01:53.440 --> 01:55.340
<b>Just in case.</b>

02:57.470 --> 03:01.780
<b>The Man of the Past</b>

03:05.680 --> 03:06.780
<b>Welcome.</b>

03:07.720 --> 03:11.750
<b>Have you seen a man
named Kondo come by here?</b>

03:11.890 --> 03:14.190
<b>Right this way.</b>

03:20.430 --> 03:22.830
<b>Thank you for coming.</b>

03:22.970 --> 03:25.330
<b>Are you Kanshiro Kondo?</b>

03:25.470 --> 03:26.770
<b>That's me.</b>

03:26.900 --> 03:28.470
<b>If you don't mind me asking...</b>

03:29.710 --> 03:31.640
<b>why did you summon the wife</b>

03:31.770 --> 03:35.310
<b>of Heizo Hasegawa,
the chief of Arson Theft Control?</b>

03:35.440 --> 03:37.280
<b>Boy, how cutthroat.</b>

03:37.750 --> 03:39.680
<b>Why did you contact me?</b>

03:40.480 --> 03:42.380
<b>Are you here alone?</b>

03:42.520 --> 03:44.620
<b>Was that a problem?</b>

03:44.750 --> 03:47.860
<b>You came here alone to see me.</b>

03:47.990 --> 03:51.260
<b>-Yes.
-Of course you did.</b>

03:54.500 --> 03:55.600
<b>Hisae...?</b>

03:56.800 --> 03:59.600
<b>I'm not here
because I wanted to see you.</b>

03:59.740 --> 04:01.500
<b>-What?
-Long ago,</b>

04:01.640 --> 04:05.470
<b>when my father had a house in Honjo...</b>

04:08.410 --> 04:10.450
<b>Hasegawa was my neighbor
on the right.</b>

04:11.510 --> 04:14.620
<b>You were my neighbor on the left.</b>

04:46.550 --> 04:48.050
<b>But...</b>

04:48.580 --> 04:50.050
<b>You went on lavishing money</b>

04:50.390 --> 04:52.390
<b>on prostitutes.</b>

05:07.900 --> 05:09.710
<b>You gave up on your rank</b>

05:09.840 --> 05:11.740
<b>and abandoned your parents.</b>

05:16.910 --> 05:20.350
<b>You stole a lot of money with a prostitute
of Yoshiwara.</b>

05:21.320 --> 05:22.650
<b>Move!</b>

05:22.790 --> 05:24.050
<b>You were caught.</b>

05:24.390 --> 05:27.860
<b>But you ran, slaughtering three people.</b>

05:27.990 --> 05:29.660
<b>After that, I...</b>

05:33.600 --> 05:36.370
<b>Hey, Hisae.</b>

05:37.000 --> 05:39.740
<b>Have you thought of getting married?</b>

05:40.640 --> 05:42.870
<b>This happened yesterday.</b>

05:46.580 --> 05:48.040
<b>What's the matter?</b>

05:48.880 --> 05:50.650
<b>Heizo.</b>

05:50.780 --> 05:53.550
<b>You're going to freeze out here.</b>

05:54.780 --> 05:56.550
<b>Sure...</b>

05:57.620 --> 06:02.660
<b>Actually, my daughter was betrayed
by an awful man.</b>

06:03.930 --> 06:06.360
<b>Nobody will accept her as a bride now.</b>

06:06.500 --> 06:08.830
<b>That's not true.</b>

06:08.960 --> 06:11.630
<b>No... it's looking hopeless.</b>

06:11.770 --> 06:13.940
<b>She's a gentle and kind girl.</b>

06:14.070 --> 06:15.970
<b>She's very dear to me.</b>

06:16.110 --> 06:19.880
<b>But this is just too pathetic.</b>

06:21.780 --> 06:23.510
<b>She was deceived</b>

06:23.650 --> 06:25.910
<b>by a terrible man.</b>

06:26.050 --> 06:28.850
<b>Nothing will come from lamenting.</b>

06:28.980 --> 06:30.450
<b>So what?</b>

06:30.590 --> 06:33.520
<b>May I accept her as my bride?</b>

06:33.660 --> 06:34.720
<b>What did you just say?</b>

06:35.390 --> 06:37.760
<b>I'll marry her.</b>

06:37.890 --> 06:40.760
<b>I hope I didn't offend you.</b>

06:40.900 --> 06:42.630
<b>Are you being serious?</b>

06:42.770 --> 06:43.970
<b>Yes, of course.</b>

06:44.100 --> 06:45.700
<b>Seriously serious?</b>

06:45.830 --> 06:48.400
<b>Yes, I am seriously serious.</b>

06:48.540 --> 06:50.570
<b>My daughter comes
with a lot of baggage.</b>

06:50.710 --> 06:53.680
<b>Who am I to judge?</b>

06:55.910 --> 06:57.680
<b>We're all in the same boat.</b>

07:02.550 --> 07:04.650
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

07:12.590 --> 07:15.900
<b>Is he really willing to marry me?</b>

07:16.030 --> 07:19.700
<b>Heizo is a big-hearted man.</b>

07:28.510 --> 07:30.680
<b>Twenty-four years have passed.</b>

07:30.810 --> 07:33.850
<b>I haven't even heard rumors about you.</b>

07:33.980 --> 07:36.590
<b>So what made you</b>

07:36.720 --> 07:38.550
<b>write that letter to me?</b>

07:38.690 --> 07:41.020
<b>-Are you afraid?
-Of what?</b>

07:41.160 --> 07:43.190
<b>If Heizo was here, I would've</b>

07:43.530 --> 07:45.130
<b>shown him right away.</b>

07:45.460 --> 07:47.030
<b>Heard he's out on a journey.</b>

07:47.160 --> 07:48.630
<b>He'll be back soon.</b>

07:48.760 --> 07:51.100
<b>-When?
-In place of Heizo,</b>

07:51.230 --> 07:53.100
<b>I'll take on your request.</b>

07:53.240 --> 07:54.970
<b>Well, that's harsh.</b>

07:55.100 --> 07:56.910
<b>I urge you to tell me now.</b>

07:57.040 --> 07:58.870
<b>Well, why don't you come in?</b>

07:59.010 --> 08:00.810
<b>I don't even want to see your face.</b>

08:00.940 --> 08:03.950
<b>You don't feel any nostalgia
about the man from the past?</b>

08:04.080 --> 08:06.050
<b>-You're a fool.
-What?</b>

08:06.650 --> 08:09.180
<b>If you have nothing to say, I'll leave now.</b>

08:09.520 --> 08:12.720
<b>They say that the "first man"
is unforgettable.</b>

08:12.860 --> 08:15.820
<b>So you must be a cold-blooded woman.</b>

08:15.960 --> 08:17.060
<b>What nonsense.</b>

08:18.190 --> 08:21.130
<b>Don't speak to me like that!</b>

08:26.200 --> 08:28.570
<b>Excuse me.</b>

08:31.010 --> 08:33.540
<b>Don't be surprised when you get home.</b>

08:49.290 --> 08:51.760
<b>Let me have a cup of tea.</b>

08:53.100 --> 08:55.200
<b>Here you go.</b>

08:59.900 --> 09:02.240
<b>Thanks.</b>

09:07.810 --> 09:09.180
<b>My lady!</b>

09:09.310 --> 09:10.550
<b>What's the matter?</b>

09:11.580 --> 09:13.080
<b>Sajima!</b>

09:13.220 --> 09:14.820
<b>Our lady has returned!</b>

09:15.920 --> 09:16.990
<b>My lady!</b>

09:17.620 --> 09:18.920
<b>You're safe.</b>

09:19.050 --> 09:21.160
<b>What do you mean?</b>

09:21.290 --> 09:24.560
<b>Were you visiting the Hariti?</b>

09:24.830 --> 09:30.600
<b>I arrived right when
you left the residence.</b>

09:33.100 --> 09:36.070
<b>So the lady is out today?</b>

09:36.200 --> 09:38.040
<b>That's unusual.</b>

09:38.170 --> 09:39.880
<b>It's good for her to take a break</b>

09:40.010 --> 09:41.310
<b>while Mr. Hasegawa is gone.</b>

09:42.140 --> 09:44.150
<b>It's true.</b>

09:44.280 --> 09:46.980
<b>She's always taking care of us too.</b>

09:47.120 --> 09:49.350
<b>Oh, no! This is a disaster!</b>

09:49.690 --> 09:51.050
<b>Please help!</b>

09:51.190 --> 09:53.060
<b>Who are you?</b>

09:53.190 --> 09:56.660
<b>I'm from Myogaya,
a tea shop by the Hariti temple.</b>

09:56.790 --> 09:58.660
<b>Why are you so distraught?</b>

09:58.790 --> 10:01.860
<b>The madam of this residence</b>

10:02.000 --> 10:04.230
<b>was attacked by some ronin</b>

10:04.370 --> 10:06.970
<b>and was slashed with his sword!</b>

10:07.100 --> 10:08.140
<b>What?</b>

10:08.270 --> 10:11.140
<b>She's seriously wounded
and getting treated at the shop.</b>

10:11.270 --> 10:12.370
<b>Unbelievable.</b>

10:12.710 --> 10:14.380
<b>That can't be!</b>

10:14.710 --> 10:16.880
<b>Gather everyone at Yotsuya.</b>

10:17.010 --> 10:18.650
<b>Sakai, we'll go to the tea shop.</b>

10:18.780 --> 10:20.150
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

10:37.170 --> 10:40.070
<b>Where is the woman you treated?</b>

10:40.200 --> 10:43.210
<b>The lady who was wounded
at the Hariti temple!</b>

10:45.740 --> 10:49.640
<b>Turns out, it was a made-up story
by that old woman.</b>

10:49.780 --> 10:51.080
<b>The people of the shop</b>

10:51.210 --> 10:54.220
<b>weren't familiar
with the old woman at all.</b>

10:54.350 --> 10:56.020
<b>So where is she?</b>

10:56.150 --> 10:58.220
<b>She was gone before we knew it.</b>

10:58.350 --> 11:00.820
<b>We're currently
conducting a search for her.</b>

11:01.760 --> 11:03.060
<b>This is outrageous.</b>

11:03.190 --> 11:07.160
<b>Why would that old woman lie
about such thing?</b>

11:07.300 --> 11:08.730
<b>Sajima.</b>

11:09.300 --> 11:12.100
<b>A letter arrived for you?</b>

11:12.230 --> 11:13.800
<b>The sender of the letter was</b>

11:13.940 --> 11:15.440
<b>Kanshiro Kondo.</b>

11:15.770 --> 11:18.370
<b>We used to be neighbors in Honjo.</b>

11:18.710 --> 11:20.740
<b>Heizo knows about him too.</b>

11:20.880 --> 11:22.040
<b>He caused an incident</b>

11:22.180 --> 11:23.450
<b>twenty-four years ago</b>

11:23.780 --> 11:26.380
<b>and betrayed his family.</b>

11:26.720 --> 11:28.950
<b>We haven't been in contact
all these years.</b>

11:29.420 --> 11:32.990
<b>So the suspicious old woman was here</b>

11:33.120 --> 11:36.860
<b>while you were being summoned
by that man.</b>

11:37.230 --> 11:39.800
<b>So the old woman
was Kondo's accomplice?</b>

11:39.930 --> 11:42.000
<b>I don't know what they're aiming for.</b>

11:42.130 --> 11:44.030
<b>But since I was suspicious,</b>

11:44.170 --> 11:46.330
<b>I had Tsuruzo follow him.</b>

11:46.470 --> 11:49.370
<b>Well, that was very smart of you.</b>

11:50.340 --> 11:51.870
<b>What a disgrace.</b>

11:52.970 --> 11:53.980
<b>Please.</b>

11:54.980 --> 11:57.910
<b>Mother, I'm home.</b>

11:58.050 --> 11:59.250
<b>Where's Ojun?</b>

11:59.380 --> 12:01.980
<b>I bought her a gift as promised.</b>

12:03.350 --> 12:05.920
<b>Where is she?</b>

12:06.050 --> 12:07.060
<b>Ojun?</b>

12:07.190 --> 12:10.360
<b>She's probably playing hide and seek.</b>

12:10.490 --> 12:13.200
<b>She'll come out as soon
as she sees this candy.</b>

12:13.330 --> 12:15.200
<b>Is Ojun over there?</b>

12:15.800 --> 12:16.800
<b>Ojun?</b>

12:17.730 --> 12:19.200
<b>Come out!</b>

12:19.330 --> 12:21.140
<b>Ojun!</b>

12:21.270 --> 12:24.170
<b>I've got candy for you!</b>

12:24.310 --> 12:25.370
<b>Candy!</b>

12:27.240 --> 12:28.380
<b>Could it be...?</b>

12:29.210 --> 12:31.010
<b>Mother?</b>

12:33.880 --> 12:36.120
<b>Ojun! Ojun!</b>

12:36.250 --> 12:37.790
<b>My lady.</b>

12:38.950 --> 12:41.520
<b>We were just playing together</b>

12:41.860 --> 12:44.230
<b>in the room next to the kitchen.</b>

12:44.360 --> 12:46.360
<b>But now I can't find her anywhere!</b>

12:49.060 --> 12:50.330
<b>-My lady!
-Mother!</b>

12:50.470 --> 12:54.000
<b>Don't be surprised when you get home.</b>

12:54.140 --> 12:56.470
<b>He must've kidnapped Ojun.</b>

12:56.810 --> 12:58.540
<b>This is all my fault.</b>

12:58.870 --> 13:01.440
<b>We searched every part
of the residence.</b>

13:01.780 --> 13:03.980
<b>What is the name of the tea shop
you went to?</b>

13:04.310 --> 13:06.980
<b>Yoshinoya of Gokokuji.</b>

13:07.520 --> 13:10.220
<b>Sakai, have Hikojyu go to Tsuruzo</b>

13:10.350 --> 13:12.820
<b>and Kumehachi investigate Kondo.</b>

13:12.950 --> 13:15.390
<b>-Call Omasa too.
-Yes, sir!</b>

13:16.390 --> 13:17.990
<b>My lady.</b>

13:18.130 --> 13:20.500
<b>Has Ojun been kidnapped?</b>

13:20.830 --> 13:23.000
<b>This is an emergency during
the chief's absence.</b>

13:23.130 --> 13:24.870
<b>We'll get Ojun back</b>

13:25.000 --> 13:26.840
<b>no matter what.</b>

13:32.910 --> 13:35.110
<b>I'll be back in Edo tomorrow.</b>

13:37.880 --> 13:39.050
<b>Chief?</b>

13:41.550 --> 13:44.150
<b>Which is better?</b>

13:44.290 --> 13:47.090
<b>You missed Ojun the most.</b>

13:47.220 --> 13:50.260
<b>Don't laugh, help me decide.</b>

13:50.490 --> 13:52.260
<b>All right, I choose this one.</b>

13:52.590 --> 13:55.860
<b>She's like a real daughter now.</b>

13:56.360 --> 13:59.300
<b>Ojun is our daughter.</b>

13:59.430 --> 14:01.070
<b>Yes, she is.</b>

14:01.200 --> 14:03.410
<b>Ojun will be very happy.</b>

14:03.540 --> 14:05.270
<b>Do you think so?</b>

14:06.370 --> 14:08.580
<b>I sure hope so.</b>

14:15.480 --> 14:19.090
<b>My lady! Tsuruzo and Hikojyu are back!</b>

14:22.020 --> 14:23.490
<b>With the help of Hikojyu,</b>

14:23.630 --> 14:26.530
<b>I figured out where that ronin was.</b>

14:26.860 --> 14:29.970
<b>He was staying at an inn in Nezu.</b>

14:30.100 --> 14:32.570
<b>-Good.
-Thank you.</b>

14:32.900 --> 14:34.540
<b>-However...
-What?</b>

14:37.370 --> 14:39.870
<b>Someone will be here for me.</b>

14:40.010 --> 14:42.610
<b>Call me when they arrive.</b>

14:44.610 --> 14:47.420
<b>If we don't hurry, he'll leave the inn!</b>

14:47.550 --> 14:50.290
<b>He must be headed where he hid Ojun.</b>

14:50.420 --> 14:52.150
<b>If we let him run,</b>

14:52.290 --> 14:54.020
<b>we won't be able to face Chief!</b>

14:54.160 --> 14:55.420
<b>Let's hurry!</b>

14:55.560 --> 14:58.360
<b>If I had stayed,</b>

14:58.490 --> 15:01.400
<b>Ojun would've been safe.</b>

15:03.300 --> 15:05.470
<b>If they arrest Kanshiro Kondo,</b>

15:05.600 --> 15:09.070
<b>he's going to reveal it all.</b>

15:09.570 --> 15:11.170
<b>But...</b>

15:11.310 --> 15:14.180
<b>we must save Ojun no matter what.</b>

15:15.240 --> 15:19.080
<b>Ojun and Heizo would forgive me.</b>

15:23.620 --> 15:25.090
<b>Tatsuzo!</b>

15:25.220 --> 15:27.490
<b>We must go and save her at once!</b>

15:27.620 --> 15:29.220
<b>-Yes!
-Everyone.</b>

15:30.230 --> 15:33.230
<b>Please help me find Ojun.</b>

15:35.700 --> 15:38.670
<b>We will save Ojun</b>

15:39.000 --> 15:41.270
<b>and arrest the criminals at any cost!</b>

15:41.400 --> 15:43.000
<b>-Understood?
-Yes, sir!</b>

15:46.140 --> 15:47.640
<b>Thank you.</b>

15:59.350 --> 16:01.090
<b>That's him.</b>

16:01.620 --> 16:03.960
<b>-That bastard!
-No, don't!</b>

16:16.200 --> 16:17.470
<b>It turns out</b>

16:17.610 --> 16:20.610
<b>that group of ronin were seen in Sugamo
quite often lately.</b>

16:20.740 --> 16:22.480
<b>Well done, Omasa.</b>

16:22.610 --> 16:25.710
<b>I suspect that Ojun
must be kidnapped there.</b>

16:26.050 --> 16:27.520
<b>-Let's hurry!
-Yes, sir!</b>

16:28.150 --> 16:30.190
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

16:38.230 --> 16:40.430
<b>Kondo and the rest
are at that farmer's house.</b>

16:40.560 --> 16:43.100
<b>Kumehachi,
you're well-attuned to finding things.</b>

16:43.230 --> 16:44.700
<b>It's for Chief.</b>

16:45.030 --> 16:48.440
<b>I'd save Ojun in exchange for my life!</b>

16:57.210 --> 16:59.310
<b>All right, let's surround them.</b>

16:59.450 --> 17:01.020
<b>Omasa, you'll get Ojun.</b>

17:01.150 --> 17:03.020
<b>-Leave it to me.
-Koyanagi,</b>

17:03.150 --> 17:05.190
<b>-don't let a soul escape.
-Yes, sir!</b>

17:17.170 --> 17:19.400
<b>What the...?</b>

17:32.280 --> 17:33.620
<b>Omasa retrieved Ojun.</b>

17:33.750 --> 17:36.150
<b>-Now set the fire!
-Yes, sir.</b>

17:36.520 --> 17:39.550
<b>The Arson Theft Control
is known to be rough.</b>

17:39.820 --> 17:43.790
<b>This is for kidnapping Ojun!</b>

17:44.690 --> 17:46.760
<b>There's no room for them to escape.</b>

17:48.300 --> 17:49.400
<b>What is it?</b>

17:55.270 --> 17:56.600
<b>Who's there?</b>

18:01.810 --> 18:03.550
<b>Bastards...</b>

18:04.310 --> 18:08.420
<b>Don't underestimate the snoop
of Arson Theft Control!</b>

18:17.560 --> 18:19.290
<b>Brace yourself!</b>

18:21.360 --> 18:22.860
<b>How dare you kidnap Ojun!</b>

18:30.740 --> 18:32.470
<b>Thanks for that.</b>

18:43.420 --> 18:46.150
<b>This is for Chief!</b>

19:09.910 --> 19:12.710
<b>Mother... Mother...!</b>

19:14.350 --> 19:16.450
<b>Ojun... Ojun...</b>

19:17.490 --> 19:20.720
<b>I'm so glad to see you safe.</b>

19:39.740 --> 19:42.510
<b>Kanshiro, it's been a while.</b>

19:47.520 --> 19:50.850
<b>So what was your scheme?</b>

19:51.190 --> 19:53.390
<b>Were you trying to threaten Hisae</b>

19:53.520 --> 19:55.560
<b>and beg for money?</b>

19:55.690 --> 19:59.330
<b>Well, aren't you confident?</b>

19:59.460 --> 20:02.830
<b>They say, "ignorance is bliss"
for this reason.</b>

20:03.830 --> 20:05.230
<b>What do you mean?</b>

20:05.730 --> 20:09.240
<b>Let me tell you
about your wife's true nature.</b>

20:09.600 --> 20:11.940
<b>Hisae's true nature?</b>

20:12.410 --> 20:13.840
<b>Your wife</b>

20:13.980 --> 20:17.810
<b>used to be mine and I was her first man!</b>

20:17.950 --> 20:20.650
<b>I was the one who made her a woman.</b>

20:20.780 --> 20:22.950
<b>There, aren't you mad?</b>

20:30.730 --> 20:31.990
<b>What's so funny?</b>

20:32.330 --> 20:35.000
<b>That's all trivial to me.</b>

20:35.330 --> 20:37.830
<b>What? Trivial?</b>

20:37.970 --> 20:39.630
<b>Hisae is a wonderful woman,</b>

20:39.770 --> 20:41.970
<b>in the past and present.</b>

20:42.840 --> 20:46.710
<b>And she's mine,
for many years to come.</b>

20:49.940 --> 20:54.750
<b>One, two, three, four, five</b>

20:54.880 --> 20:59.590
<b>Six, seven, eight, nine, ten</b>

20:59.720 --> 21:01.460
<b>You're here.</b>

21:05.260 --> 21:07.330
<b>You were out playing</b>

21:07.460 --> 21:10.430
<b>while the residence
was in an emergency.</b>

21:10.570 --> 21:12.770
<b>I'll never forget about this.</b>

21:12.900 --> 21:16.000
<b>-Yes.
-If you neglect your duties,</b>

21:16.340 --> 21:18.410
<b>just know that you'll be
executed next time.</b>

21:18.940 --> 21:20.680
<b>Even if you're my son!</b>

21:20.980 --> 21:22.510
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

21:26.810 --> 21:28.050
<b>In any case,</b>

21:28.380 --> 21:30.490
<b>that was very bold of you.</b>

21:31.450 --> 21:34.760
<b>I don't care about the past at all.</b>

21:35.620 --> 21:38.690
<b>So delicious.
I missed your home-cooking so much,</b>

21:38.830 --> 21:40.500
<b>that I dreamt about it.</b>

21:42.330 --> 21:43.500
<b>That's it.</b>

21:44.330 --> 21:46.900
<b>I just want to see you smile.</b>

21:47.840 --> 21:49.540
<b>I realized something</b>

21:49.670 --> 21:52.570
<b>from this ordeal.</b>

21:52.710 --> 21:54.880
<b>-What is it?
-A woman</b>

21:55.010 --> 21:57.380
<b>is dependent upon their man.</b>

21:59.010 --> 22:02.620
<b>I'm very fortunate.</b>

22:03.650 --> 22:08.360
<b>That's for me to say.</b>

22:21.040 --> 22:27.380
<b>People are creatures born from dreams</b>

22:27.510 --> 22:33.050
<b>How can the sky look so blue?</b>

22:33.380 --> 22:39.020
<b>The past and future are just short-lived moments</b>

22:39.490 --> 22:44.830
<b>that exist between the blink of an eye</b>

22:47.800 --> 22:50.030
<b>Oh, time…</b>

22:50.360 --> 22:54.040
<b>I could be a flower of spring</b>

22:54.370 --> 22:59.070
<b>in my next life</b>

23:00.070 --> 23:05.150
<b>And then… live on</b>

23:06.010 --> 23:11.520
<b>…and then… be loved</b>

23:20.430 --> 23:23.730
<b>And then… cry</b>

23:27.030 --> 23:33.040
<b>…and then… fall</b>

23:41.080 --> 23:47.420
<b>Koyanagi of Arson Theft Control lost
his family and he was depressed.</b>

23:47.760 --> 23:50.660
<b>One day, he saved a woman along with her child.</b>

23:51.430 --> 23:53.760
<b>Next on Onihei, "The Audacious Fellow."</b>

23:53.900 --> 23:54.900
<b>The Audacious Fellow</b>
